OL,3,AHealth and safety inquiry after fatal
OL,4,Atiger attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA health and safety investigation has
OL,7,Fbeen launched into the death of a man
OL,8,Fwho was killed by a tiger after he
OL,9,Fentered its enclosure.
OL,11,FYorkshire Wildlife Park was closed over
OL,12,Fthe weekend following reports of a man
OL,13,Fclimbing down into the enclosure from a
OL,14,Fwalkway on Saturday afternoon.
OL,16,FAn eyewitness described seeing the man
OL,17,Fwearing headphones and "pacing around"
OL,18,Fnear the enclosure before he went in
OL,19,Fand was attacked. South Yorkshire
OL,20,FPolice confirmed he was visiting the
OL,21,Fpark on his own.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
